<title>USA: TENNIS-ACURA CLASSIC WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ACURA CLASSIC WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MANHATTAN BEACH, California 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from</p>
<p>the $450,000 Acura Classic women's tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Thursday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Quarter-finals</p>
<p>2-Monica Seles (U.S.) beat Natasha Zvereva (Belarus) 6-1 6-1</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>5-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain) beat Ai Sugiyama (Japan)</p>
<p>6-3 7-5</p>
<p>6-Anke Huber (Germany) beat Venus Williams (U.S.) 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Nathalie Tauziat (France) beat 8-Kimberly Po (U.S.) 7-6 (9-7)</p>
<p>4-6 6-4</p>
</text>
